MotionDuo
=========

MotionDuo is a modified version of Mousehop
(https://github.com/jondkinney/mousehop), which is a fork of lan-mouse
(https://github.com/feschber/lan-mouse).

MotionDuo source: https://github.com/alvin-7/motionduo

MotionDuo modifications are maintained by alvin-7 and the MotionDuo
contributors. This branch was renamed MotionDuo in October 2026. Changes
include the native Go frontend, cross-device clipboard synchronization,
input transport and settings improvements, and new MotionDuo artwork.
